   CCoonnttrrooll ooppeerraattiioonnss
     These operations are not modes, but rather commands to be performed by
     the tty layer.

     oossttaarrtt  Performs a “start output” operation, as normally done by an in‐
             coming START character when iixxoonn is set.

     oossttoopp   Performs a “stop output” operation, as normally done by an incom‐
